From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mscoree: runtime strings, LockClrVersion, remote runtimes, legacy v2 query, GetProcAddress (3647)

mscoree: runtime strings, LockClrVersion, runtimes in other processes, legacy v2 query, GetProcAddress

LoadStringRC(Ex) and ICLRRuntimeInfo::LoadErrorString read mscorrc.dll of the runtime's
directory, ICLRRuntimeInfo::IsLoaded and EnumerateLoadedRuntimes detect runtimes of other
processes by their runtime library, QueryLegacyV2RuntimeBinding returns the bound runtime,
ICLRRuntimeInfo::GetProcAddress/GetRealProcAddress, LockClrVersion (callback on first runtime
load), IClassFactory::LockServer counts and DllCanUnloadNow is explicit.
---
